What is the output when the following program is executed?
```java
class DataCorruptException extends RuntimeException {
    public DataCorruptException(String msg) { super(msg); }
}
public class Processor {
    static void process() {
        if (true) {
            throw new DataCorruptException("Corruption detected");
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            process();
        } catch (DataCorruptException e) {
            System.out.println(e.getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

